	<rowsItem>
		<index>11</index>
		<row>
			<columnsID>5114ab2d-09c9-4a39-a54a-c5a85ea40a84</columnsID>
			<formatIndex>20</formatIndex>
			<c>
				<i>1</i>
				<c>
					<f>41</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Warning. Account is valid till [ValidityPeriod]
Paying this invoice means that you agree with the goods delivery conditions.
Advice of payment is obligatory, otherwise goods availability in the warehouse is not guaranteed.
Goods are issued once the funds are received 
to the Vendor's bank account, by customer pickup, only after presenting a letter of authority or ID.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>هشدار. حساب تا [ValidityPeriod] معتبر است
پرداخت این فاکتور به معنای موافقت شما با شرایط تحویل کالا است.
اعلام پرداخت الزامی است، در غیر این صورت موجود بودن کالا در انبار تضمین نمی‌شود.
کالا پس از واریز وجه 
به حساب بانکی فروشنده، با تحویل حضوری توسط مشتری و فقط پس از ارائه وکالت‌نامه یا کارت شناسایی تحویل داده می‌شود.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>it</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Warning! Account is valid till [ValidityPeriod]
Paying this invoice means that you agree with the goods delivery conditions.
Advice of payment is obligatory, otherwise, goods availability in the warehouse is not guaranteed.
Goods are issued once the funds are received 
to the Supplier's bank account, by customer pickup, only after presenting a letter of authority or ID.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>pl</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Warning! Account is valid till [ValidityPeriod]
Paying this invoice means that you agree with the goods delivery conditions.
Advice of payment is obligatory, otherwise, goods availability in the warehouse is not guaranteed.
Goods are issued once the funds are received 
to the Supplier's bank account, by customer pickup, only after presenting a letter of authority or ID.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Warning! Account is valid till [ValidityPeriod]
Paying this invoice means that you agree with the goods delivery conditions.
Advice of payment is obligatory, otherwise, goods availability in the warehouse is not guaranteed.
Goods are issued once the funds are received 
to the Supplier's bank account, by customer pickup, only after presenting a letter of authority or ID.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>tr</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Warning! Account is valid till [ValidityPeriod]
Paying this invoice means that you agree with the goods delivery conditions.
Advice of payment is obligatory, otherwise, goods availability in the warehouse is not guaranteed.
Goods are issued once the funds are received 
to the Supplier's bank account, by customer pickup, only after presenting a letter of authority or ID.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>vi</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Chú ý! Tài khoản có hiệu lực đến khi [ValidityPeriod]
Thanh toán hóa đơn này, nghĩa là bạn chấp nhận các điều khoản giao hàng.
Dịch vụ thanh toán là bắt buộc, nếu không, sẽ không đảm bảo có sẵn hàng trong kho.
Hàng hóa chỉ được giao sau khi Nhà cung cấp 
đã nhận tiền vào tài khoản và Khách hàng xuất trình giấy ủy quyền hoặc ID.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
